      "jcr:created": "Thu Nov 16 2023 14:36:50 GMT+0000",
      "text": "Osteoarthritis is the most common form of arthritis, impacting more than 500 million people worldwide.1 After a successful 20-year career as an operating room nurse, Carolyn was diagnosed with osteoarthritis in her hip. Now, after working with her doctor to get a Mako Total Hip surgery, Carolyn’s back to the things she loves, like enjoying time with her grandchild. Watch her story. “The Mako Total Hip replacement was a great choice for me. I feel better than I have in a long time, I can get back to the activities that I love to do. I never should have put it off for so long.” ______________ Carolyn Mako Total Hip replacement patient",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Nov 16 2023 14:45:52 GMT+0000",
